{"game": "space-marine-2", "language": "english", "appid": 2183900, "month": "2025-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1763856000, "end_date": 1764547199, "month_true_total": 2593, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-09-11 02:22:35 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "212196315", "author": {"steamid": "76561199208673323", "personaname": "MrGrimTheReaper", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199208673323/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1970, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 73, "playtime_at_review": 192, "last_played": 1788465680, "avatar": "57066ab157ae8d6c475814e79115de61d59e16f2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just pure testosterone!", "timestamp_created": 1764546926, "timestamp_updated": 1764546926, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212196045", "author": {"steamid": "76561198418435586", "personaname": "Krono", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198418435586/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 691, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 557, "last_played": 1766104558, "avatar": "97caee00eb9e2fd9f78eaf034b7f9f4d2fd9210d"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is honestly one of the most brutal (and fun) games that I have ever played. I'm not much of a warhammer fanatic, but a dear friend of mine had gotten me delving into this masterpiece of a game. \r\n\r\nI will say, the cons are probably the...controls? It had felt a bit weird to block/parry with C instead of having the melee be a third individual weapon within your arsenal. Usually it's something like right click. But even those can be configured, so not all of it is so bad.\r\n\r\nI find the story of Titus to be...interesting. So far, all I know is how Lieutenant Titus had been exposed to chaos and is now afflicted by some object that the tech priests retrieve on the first mission, which sparked some interest enough for me to get into the warhammer lore. I've also been playing darktide recently too, so I could get a bit more of a vast knowledge outside of just the Space Marines.\r\n\r\nOverall, this game is....pretty good. I love the combat and just the aesthetic of the Warhammer franchise.", "timestamp_created": 1764546808, "timestamp_updated": 1764546808, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212193726", "author": {"steamid": "76561199880102829", "personaname": "willeyinkc", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199880102829/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 6242, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 12, "playtime_at_review": 4821, "last_played": 1788741993, "avatar": "d22be868a6b575f97fc3d34fb37f5ee376cd4b0c"}, "language": "english", "review": "High Action game to make you FEEL LIKE A MAN!!", "timestamp_created": 1764545728, "timestamp_updated": 1764545728, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212192036", "author": {"steamid": "76561198335438195", "personaname": "Emilx2000", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Emilx2000/", "num